WEBVTT

00:11.770 --> 00:15.770
Someone's wish is flying by again...

00:17.050 --> 00:20.249
What... was that?

00:20.250 --> 00:24.210
A wish upon a star
that... I'm not aware of?

00:26.760 --> 00:31.629
Releasing all the girls who
became LRIGs from their cards...

00:31.630 --> 00:38.229
There's no way that Tama can
make that wish come true when I can't.

00:38.230 --> 00:40.139
Yet, Ru...

00:40.140 --> 00:41.799
Kominato Ruko is...

00:41.800 --> 00:43.940
"White Room" "Large Window" "Mayu"

00:43.940 --> 00:45.240
"Mayu"

00:43.941 --> 00:45.540
Hello...?

00:45.540 --> 00:49.530
Are you... Futase Fumio-<i>sensei</i>?

01:14.670 --> 01:16.169
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:16.170 --> 01:20.179
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

01:20.180 --> 01:22.909
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:22.910 --> 01:25.749
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:25.750 --> 01:27.079
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:27.080 --> 01:31.249
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:31.250 --> 01:36.259
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

01:36.260 --> 01:40.699
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:40.700 --> 01:43.329
<i>you're there</i>

01:43.330 --> 01:46.129
<i>with a smile</i>

01:46.130 --> 01:51.639
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:51.640 --> 01:55.040
<i>And still</i>

01:56.710 --> 01:59.879
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:59.880 --> 02:04.289
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

02:04.290 --> 02:06.719
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

02:06.720 --> 02:08.389
<i>Now cross</i>

02:08.390 --> 02:11.059
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:11.060 --> 02:18.029
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:18.030 --> 02:24.530
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:27.310 --> 02:29.809
Are you really...

02:29.810 --> 02:31.179
Indeed.

02:31.180 --> 02:33.079
I'm Futase Fumio.

02:33.080 --> 02:36.149
I thought an adult was doing the writing.

02:36.150 --> 02:38.919
You're a... high school student?

02:38.920 --> 02:41.189
Fujikou's uniform...

02:41.190 --> 02:44.090
I'd never be able to get in there...

02:45.760 --> 02:48.429
So, who will be battling us first?

02:48.430 --> 02:49.529
You're...

02:49.530 --> 02:50.929
a Selector?!

02:50.930 --> 02:54.430
Let us now head to our stage of battle.

02:55.940 --> 02:58.769
A high school girl author <i>and</i> a Selector?!

02:58.770 --> 03:00.839
Now things are heating up!

03:00.840 --> 03:03.209
It's like Chiyori's a burning chorizo!

03:03.210 --> 03:07.119
W-We didn't come here to battle.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.050
Oh?

03:08.051 --> 03:13.959
I can't fathom any other reason why Selectors
would get in contact aside from doing battle.

03:13.960 --> 03:17.289
Battles shouldn't be held
because you're Selectors.

03:17.290 --> 03:20.229
Now that is truly incomprehensible.

03:20.230 --> 03:23.229
Don't you girls have any
wish you want made true?

03:23.230 --> 03:25.769
Wishes don't come true...

03:25.770 --> 03:28.269
They come true, and yet... they don't.

03:28.270 --> 03:32.809
Futase-<i>san</i>, I think you'll
understand if you learn the truth.

03:32.810 --> 03:35.479
The truth, hm...?

03:35.480 --> 03:37.549
You're an LRIG, so you should know!

03:37.550 --> 03:40.549
Why yes, I do know...

03:40.550 --> 03:42.579
But as luck would have it...

03:42.580 --> 03:44.749
I'm aware, too.

03:44.750 --> 03:47.059
About this "truth" you speak of...

03:47.060 --> 03:51.289
About what lies beyond Selector battles...

03:51.290 --> 03:52.620
What...?

03:53.460 --> 03:56.545
"The Flames of Void Play

03:53.630 --> 03:55.799
"The ruler of White Garden...

03:55.800 --> 03:59.899
The almighty being that holds
dominion over all the WIXOSS battles...

03:56.546 --> 03:59.630
the Victory Song of Oblivion"

03:59.900 --> 04:06.409
The girl's lips speak the
laws of the Selectors..."

04:06.410 --> 04:07.340
Say...

04:07.341 --> 04:11.070
The author... How much
do you think she knows?

04:12.980 --> 04:16.779
You really are a drag...

04:16.780 --> 04:18.689
Ru...

04:18.690 --> 04:21.759
Wh-What did you just say...?

04:21.760 --> 04:24.089
Fumio said she knows.

04:24.090 --> 04:27.759
Of what lies beyond the
battles between Selectors.

04:27.760 --> 04:34.839
A Selector who loses three times has their
wish reversed, with a cruel end in wait.

04:34.840 --> 04:39.839
Assuming one continues to win
battles to become an Eternal Girl...

04:39.840 --> 04:43.879
the one who fulfills the wish is
the LRIG released from the card.

04:43.880 --> 04:49.219
I'm also aware that the Selector
is then turned into an LRIG.

04:49.220 --> 04:51.789
Then why are you still battling?!

04:51.790 --> 04:55.019
Nothing good can come from it!

04:55.020 --> 04:57.159
I see...

04:57.160 --> 05:02.459
Despite being Selectors,
you girls deny Selector battles?

05:02.460 --> 05:04.329
Quite an interesting take.

05:04.330 --> 05:07.899
The Selectors who have come
to see me after reading my novel...

05:07.900 --> 05:12.539
have all willingly
accepted battle with me.

05:12.540 --> 05:15.739
That's because of how you
wrote about it in your novel!

05:15.740 --> 05:17.909
Futase-<i>san</i>, please tell me.

05:17.910 --> 05:24.180
Don't you... know more than
what's written in the novel?

05:25.750 --> 05:29.089
Knowing that must be your wish.

05:29.090 --> 05:30.090
Huh?

05:30.091 --> 05:33.529
If so, let us be like Selectors.

05:33.530 --> 05:38.499
If you can defeat me in battle,
I'll tell you everything that I know.

05:38.500 --> 05:39.829
In battle...?

05:39.830 --> 05:44.339
There's no such thing as getting
something without doing anything.

05:44.340 --> 05:48.039
As an aside, Fumio hasn't lost once yet.

05:48.040 --> 05:50.109
What about you?

05:50.110 --> 05:51.579
Me too...

05:51.580 --> 05:54.779
The risks at hand lack excitement, but...

05:54.780 --> 05:58.240
in turn, I don't see
anything holding you back.

06:00.290 --> 06:01.789
Hey, hey!

06:01.790 --> 06:05.289
If Ruko-<i>san</i> doesn't wanna do it,
Chiyori wants to do it!

06:05.290 --> 06:05.890
Huh?!

06:05.891 --> 06:07.959
H-Hey, wait a sec...!

06:07.960 --> 06:10.299
Aw, geez... this girl...

06:10.300 --> 06:13.299
Does she even understand
she's lost twice already?

06:13.300 --> 06:14.399
Nah, not a bit...

06:14.400 --> 06:18.269
I don't care who faces me.

06:18.270 --> 06:20.109
Hey, hey!

06:20.110 --> 06:23.779
It looks like it's decided.

06:23.780 --> 06:26.479
I'll face that small lady there.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.979
Yahoo!
I'll do it.

06:27.980 --> 06:28.820
Huh?

06:28.820 --> 06:29.820
Ruko?!

06:29.821 --> 06:31.319
Ah, um...

06:31.320 --> 06:34.919
We can't have you battle with
your two losses, Chiyori-<i>san.</i>

06:34.920 --> 06:37.720
S-She nabbed my chance!
Hey! Read between the lines!

06:38.930 --> 06:40.899
Please, Iona-<i>san...</i>

06:40.900 --> 06:42.120
What...?

06:44.330 --> 06:46.469
That LRIG...

06:46.470 --> 06:47.839
No...

06:47.840 --> 06:49.399
Now, let's begin.

06:49.400 --> 06:50.570
Open!

06:54.940 --> 06:58.679
Let's do this in grace.

06:58.680 --> 07:01.649
Why does this have to happen?!

07:01.650 --> 07:03.119
Ruko...

07:03.120 --> 07:06.489
I'm... trying to do battle again...

07:06.490 --> 07:08.920
Even after Tama said not to...!

07:10.760 --> 07:13.820
Let's open the show for an
enjoyable stage performance!

07:16.500 --> 07:18.369
I go first.

07:18.370 --> 07:20.299
Grow!

07:20.300 --> 07:22.199
I summon Triumphal Arch and Clay!

07:22.200 --> 07:23.600
Grow.

07:24.610 --> 07:27.540
I Banish Triumphal Arch with Fallen Bind.

07:33.050 --> 07:33.980
Iona-<i>san</i>!

07:33.981 --> 07:35.779
Don't worry about me.

07:35.780 --> 07:36.720
It's your turn.

07:36.721 --> 07:38.289
O-Okay...

07:38.290 --> 07:41.019
I Banish Puri with Slash Miracle!

07:41.020 --> 07:44.790
Very well. I bring Surrelis
to my hand with Puri's ability.

07:54.370 --> 07:55.639
I-I'm sorry...

07:55.640 --> 08:00.409
Without Tama, she's not
showing her true potential...

08:00.410 --> 08:01.839
Ruko...

08:01.840 --> 08:03.509
Could that black LRIG be...?

08:03.510 --> 08:06.979
So, you sense something from her, too?

08:06.980 --> 08:08.749
Something different from us...

08:08.750 --> 08:12.319
Something... special.

08:12.320 --> 08:15.989
But, it looks like her affinity
with her Selector is terrible.

08:15.990 --> 08:18.089
They aren't exhibiting their actual powers.

08:18.090 --> 08:20.820
Well then, let's make them serious...

08:35.740 --> 08:38.209
She's strong...

08:38.210 --> 08:41.779
Her strategies are precise and effective...

08:41.780 --> 08:44.289
and she's a step ahead of me...

08:44.290 --> 08:47.389
How much longer are you
going to worry indecisively?

08:47.390 --> 08:50.459
I-I'm not being indecisive!

08:50.460 --> 08:53.899
Before, you were hungry for battles

08:53.900 --> 08:57.029
and held strength to overcome
expectations and experiences...

08:57.030 --> 08:58.799
I●●●

08:58.800 --> 09:04.469
I can't imagine you being
able to help anyone now...

09:04.470 --> 09:09.039
Neither Yuzuki or any of the
other girls who became LRIGs...

09:09.040 --> 09:11.579
I'll save them!

09:11.580 --> 09:14.419
I know...

09:14.420 --> 09:20.419
I know the horrible things Hitoe went
through after her wish was reversed...

09:20.420 --> 09:27.059
Yuzuki did her best to have her wish
come true, only to become an LRIG...

09:27.060 --> 09:28.659
It's all horrible!

09:28.660 --> 09:31.499
I don't want anyone to
experience the same feelings!

09:31.500 --> 09:32.830
Grow!

09:34.440 --> 09:37.169
Easier said than done.

09:37.170 --> 09:41.779
I lost to you...! You, spewing
out those despicable words!

09:41.780 --> 09:46.509
To a fool, who was doing
her best to help others...

09:46.510 --> 09:50.519
To such foolish purity...

09:50.520 --> 09:51.749
Iona-<i>san...</i>

09:51.750 --> 09:58.429
If you want to save everyone, don't let needless
things sway you, and show your true self!

09:58.430 --> 10:02.759
You're not the same as how you
were when Tama was with you!

10:02.760 --> 10:06.360
At this rate... you won't
even be able to save Tama!

10:08.440 --> 10:09.770
Tama...

10:17.610 --> 10:19.179
That's right...

10:19.180 --> 10:22.119
I need to battle...

10:22.120 --> 10:24.949
Tama... Everyone...

10:24.950 --> 10:26.989
I'm going to...

10:26.990 --> 10:29.059
save them all!

10:29.060 --> 10:31.389
I'm sorry to dampen things, but...

10:31.390 --> 10:37.160
reality isn't like a story where you can
turn the tables to get out of a predicament.

10:43.900 --> 10:45.669
Lose.

10:45.670 --> 10:48.170
I won't lose...!

10:49.380 --> 10:51.209
Iona-<i>san</i>, Grow!

10:51.210 --> 10:52.150
What?!

10:52.151 --> 10:53.349
What the...?!

10:53.350 --> 10:55.149
She's already Level 4!

10:55.150 --> 10:57.410
There's no level higher than...!

10:59.020 --> 11:01.820
What's... that...?

11:11.030 --> 11:15.099
What's with that form...?

11:15.100 --> 11:18.409
This is... Ruko's power...?

11:18.410 --> 11:22.209
The power that Tama felt from Ruko...?

11:22.210 --> 11:24.109
It... It can't be...

11:24.110 --> 11:27.519
There's nothing in the scripts
of anything above Level 4...

11:27.520 --> 11:29.350
Of a Level 5...

11:30.450 --> 11:33.119
L-Lookie! We got a Level 5!

11:33.120 --> 11:36.519
Could this be the forbidden power
that awakens in a time of crisis?!

11:36.520 --> 11:40.189
What an exciting, and
cliché turn of events!

11:40.190 --> 11:42.359
It looks like Ruko... is having fun.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.360
Yup.

11:43.361 --> 11:45.769
But, that's the good Ruko, right?

11:45.770 --> 11:47.030
I think so.

11:48.600 --> 11:53.639
It would be nice... to get an encore now...

11:53.640 --> 11:55.200
Time to close the curtains.

12:06.920 --> 12:10.089
I'm sorry... Fumio...

12:10.090 --> 12:12.420
No, that's fine...

12:13.590 --> 12:15.899
Iona-<i>san</i>, thank you.

12:15.900 --> 12:19.429
With your words, Iona-<i>san</i>, I...

12:19.430 --> 12:21.399
Why...

12:21.400 --> 12:23.390
did I say that?

12:29.340 --> 12:31.979
Level 5 was quite a surprise.

12:31.980 --> 12:33.149
Your LRIG...

12:33.150 --> 12:35.079
Huh?

12:35.080 --> 12:39.689
How much does Iona-<i>kun</i> know
about the girl named "Mayu"?

12:39.690 --> 12:41.259
Mayu!

12:41.260 --> 12:45.089
Just so you know, I
didn't tell her about her.

12:45.090 --> 12:50.529
Fumio knew all about it,
from before she met me.

12:50.530 --> 12:52.869
What?! How...?!

12:52.870 --> 12:55.439
Before being Futase Fumio...

12:55.440 --> 12:58.100
I was an LRIG.

13:03.180 --> 13:05.649
An LRIG...?

13:05.650 --> 13:11.019
Th-Then... after returning as a human,
you've become a Selector again?!

13:11.020 --> 13:13.289
But why?

13:13.290 --> 13:16.190
All in the name of a wish.

13:17.360 --> 13:20.189
To fulfill...

13:20.190 --> 13:22.459
her wish.

13:22.460 --> 13:27.460
Futase Fumio... is not my real name.

13:28.970 --> 13:31.139
The name "Fumio" was...

13:31.140 --> 13:35.579
the name of a girl who was a Selector.

13:35.580 --> 13:37.549
You can move?

13:37.550 --> 13:39.649
Can't you see?

13:39.650 --> 13:41.919
So, you can talk, too.

13:41.920 --> 13:43.749
You can hear me, right?

13:43.750 --> 13:44.819
Oh?

13:44.820 --> 13:46.389
Come on...

13:46.390 --> 13:48.319
Are you serious?

13:48.320 --> 13:52.090
You're not acting very
surprised for hearing a card talk.

13:53.260 --> 13:57.890
I've read a number of
similar stories like this already.

13:59.000 --> 14:01.769
I guess introductions are in place.

14:01.770 --> 14:03.499
My name is Fumio.

14:03.500 --> 14:04.669
What's yours?

14:04.670 --> 14:07.209
I... forgot.

14:07.210 --> 14:08.609
Just name me whatever.

14:08.610 --> 14:10.739
Then...

14:10.740 --> 14:13.709
your name from today is "Futase."

14:13.710 --> 14:19.680
Yes... Futase is the name
she gave to me as an LRIG.

14:22.260 --> 14:23.720
- "The End of the World's Wings"
- "Side Story" "Volume Two"

14:23.720 --> 14:25.120
"Next Step ● To be a Novelist..."

14:23.721 --> 14:25.120
- "Fundamentals to Writing a Novel" -
"You're an Author Before you even Noticed"

14:32.030 --> 14:34.369
Clicking and clacking every day...

14:34.370 --> 14:36.700
Is that supposed to be fun?

14:38.740 --> 14:42.239
Right now... no, it's not fun...

14:42.240 --> 14:44.949
I'm a bit irritated because
I have writer's block.

14:44.950 --> 14:47.279
Then quit.

14:47.280 --> 14:49.949
Sometimes, it's really fun.

14:49.950 --> 14:52.720
There are moments I can
sense my accomplishments.

14:53.890 --> 14:56.659
Don't you have anything like that, Futase?

14:56.660 --> 14:58.659
I●●●

14:58.660 --> 15:03.559
don't care about dreams
and wishes anymore.

15:03.560 --> 15:06.560
You make it sound like you had one before.

15:08.240 --> 15:11.469
Never mind. I won't ask anymore.

15:11.470 --> 15:14.500
Talk to me about it when
you feel like it someday.

15:16.910 --> 15:21.349
If you have a wish, you should
just look for Selectors and do battle.

15:21.350 --> 15:23.419
I suppose...

15:23.420 --> 15:28.410
No matter my suggestions,
she never partook in battles...

15:32.190 --> 15:33.429
Huh?!

15:33.430 --> 15:35.829
What do you mean you're not going to do it?

15:35.830 --> 15:40.869
There's no meaning to my dream if
I don't attain it with my own hands.

15:40.870 --> 15:43.139
Go and check on the others...

15:43.140 --> 15:45.540
You don't have to tell me that!

15:46.810 --> 15:49.639
She was lying...

15:49.640 --> 15:56.640
An LRIG only appears to girls who
have a wish they truly want to attain.

15:59.720 --> 16:01.280
I'm going.

16:15.640 --> 16:16.799
No way...!

16:16.800 --> 16:18.139
C'mon, you're joking, right?

16:18.140 --> 16:20.039
No, I'm super serious!

16:20.040 --> 16:21.979
Whoops! We gotta go to another classroom!

16:21.980 --> 16:23.810
Shoot! Let's hurry!

16:32.250 --> 16:35.719
That's a new card? That's so neat!

16:35.720 --> 16:37.219
Isn't it?

16:37.220 --> 16:39.229
Say, you want to battle me?

16:39.230 --> 16:40.389
Sure, okay!

16:40.390 --> 16:42.090
Hey, me too!

16:44.870 --> 16:48.899
Didn't you buy the cards
to play with someone?

16:48.900 --> 16:53.909
I'm not well-suited for school life.

16:53.910 --> 16:58.849
Isn't it hell, not being able
to speak the whole day?

16:58.850 --> 17:01.419
I'm used to it already.

17:01.420 --> 17:04.410
Is it fun living like that?

17:06.390 --> 17:09.189
A little, ever since I met you, Futase.

17:09.190 --> 17:10.959
R-Really?

17:10.960 --> 17:14.090
Say, look at that smile.

17:16.060 --> 17:19.430
People smile when they're happy.

17:23.440 --> 17:27.930
I became an LRIG and
lost everything, but...

17:29.940 --> 17:32.640
as time passed...

17:32.710 --> 17:33.910
"Author"

17:33.911 --> 17:35.110
"Futase Fumio"

17:44.830 --> 17:50.229
I began to wish in earnest,
for her dream to come true.

17:50.230 --> 17:51.460
But...

17:52.800 --> 17:56.469
You've got some nerve,
doing an overnighter again!

17:56.470 --> 17:57.769
I... I was working!

17:57.770 --> 18:00.169
Liar... I bet you were with another woman!

18:00.170 --> 18:03.340
Says the one fooling
around with some other guy!

18:07.080 --> 18:10.249
The reality that surrounded her...

18:10.250 --> 18:12.519
slowly gnawed away at her...

18:12.520 --> 18:13.940
"Pen Name" "Futase Fumio"

18:13.450 --> 18:16.159
Even her last speck of hope...

18:13.941 --> 18:15.360
"Results" "Failed"

18:16.160 --> 18:19.420
became shrouded by rain clouds...

18:20.860 --> 18:22.659
What?

18:22.660 --> 18:28.639
I'm not interested in a Selector
who's not interested in battling.

18:28.640 --> 18:30.999
What if I say that I'll battle?

18:31.000 --> 18:32.169
Fumio?!

18:32.170 --> 18:33.369
Oho!

18:33.370 --> 18:35.309
Now you're talking!

18:35.310 --> 18:36.809
Hey, Fumio!

18:36.810 --> 18:40.449
You need to get your wish
with your own hands, right?!

18:40.450 --> 18:41.779
That's right.

18:41.780 --> 18:44.149
That's right, but...

18:44.150 --> 18:45.949
I'm at my limit.

18:45.950 --> 18:50.989
If my dream doesn't come true,
my life would all be for nothing.

18:50.990 --> 18:56.120
It's miserable just
living in futility like this...

18:57.700 --> 19:01.690
So Futase, please lend me your hand...

19:02.800 --> 19:04.739
I understand...

19:04.740 --> 19:09.139
Then... I'll make your
wish come true, Fumio.

19:09.140 --> 19:12.249
Thank you, Futase...

19:12.250 --> 19:16.310
That's why... I'm your LRIG!

19:17.420 --> 19:19.989
Now then, let's begin.

19:19.990 --> 19:21.180
Open!

19:22.020 --> 19:25.359
She was exceptional as a Selector.

19:25.360 --> 19:28.999
She never lost a single
time for her wish...

19:29.000 --> 19:31.990
and kept on winning.

19:33.870 --> 19:35.899
Then...

19:35.900 --> 19:38.009
I accept...

19:38.010 --> 19:40.769
the laws of the Selector.

19:40.770 --> 19:42.339
And now...

19:42.340 --> 19:45.340
a new Eternal Girl will be born!

19:47.080 --> 19:51.849
So now, my wish is going to come true...

19:51.850 --> 19:54.580
I'll make it come true.

19:56.690 --> 19:58.389
Futase?

19:58.390 --> 20:01.859
I'll make sure your wish comes true.

20:01.860 --> 20:04.129
Leave it to me...

20:04.130 --> 20:06.930
What... are you talking about?

20:12.910 --> 20:16.109
The girl who dreamed
of becoming a novelist...

20:16.110 --> 20:18.370
became an Eternal Girl.

20:28.620 --> 20:31.729
The LRIG tasked with the girl's wish...

20:31.730 --> 20:34.059
went down the river of stars...

20:34.060 --> 20:39.269
and soon found the room
where the girl of fate slept.

20:39.270 --> 20:41.399
The Girl of White...

20:41.400 --> 20:45.739
had a very beautiful, good heart.

20:45.740 --> 20:47.569
On the other hand...

20:47.570 --> 20:52.740
the Girl of Black had a
very unsightly, evil heart.

20:54.350 --> 21:02.319
The Girl of Black envied and hated the
ever happy and smiling Girl of White...

21:02.320 --> 21:06.990
and thought of erasing
her very existence.

21:08.260 --> 21:11.430
Girl... of Black?

21:12.830 --> 21:17.600
I sense something from her
that's different from other LRIGs.

21:19.110 --> 21:20.609
Iona-<i>kun.</i>

21:20.610 --> 21:21.809
Aren't you...

21:21.810 --> 21:24.540
the Girl of Black?

21:26.480 --> 21:29.380
Girl of Black...?

21:35.460 --> 21:37.689
No...

21:37.690 --> 21:39.630
Don't, Iona...

21:42.060 --> 21:44.029
The Girl of Black...

21:44.030 --> 21:47.969
can't become the Girl of White.

21:47.970 --> 21:50.130
Longing of such...

21:51.340 --> 21:53.320
will dirty you...

21:53.321 --> 21:55.900
"This Impatience Is an Awakening"

21:54.170 --> 21:55.900
to a shade of gray.

22:02.320 --> 22:03.719
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.720 --> 22:09.159
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.160 --> 22:13.689
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.690 --> 22:15.259
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.260 --> 22:20.899
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:20.900 --> 22:25.609
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.610 --> 22:31.079
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.080 --> 22:37.249
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.250 --> 22:42.359
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.360 --> 22:50.360
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.100 --> 22:59.139
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.140 --> 23:05.879
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:05.880 --> 23:10.919
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:10.920 --> 23:13.549
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.550 --> 23:20.620
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.830 --> 23:29.239
Girl of Black...

23:29.240 --> 23:32.109
Girl of Dark...

23:32.110 --> 23:34.439
Girl of Black...

23:34.440 --> 23:37.109
Girl of Dark...

23:37.110 --> 23:38.479
Truth is...

23:38.480 --> 23:40.940
"That Existence is Dark Black"

23:38.610 --> 23:40.910
That Existence is Dark Black.
